--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogHeartLevel_es-ES
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: es-ES
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ef78ba17aeb35f4190d798b5eeab281, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1932895547392
    m_Localized: "Dale a tu\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41881006080
    m_Localized: "\xA1Hola! \xBFTe ves con fuerzas para empezar tu primer d\xEDa
      de trabajo? Te voy a mostrar un poco tu zona de trabajo y las tareas de hoy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626078015488
    m_Localized: We take this job very seriously, so I need you to be careful and
      think through your actions before doing anything. They can have consequences,
      and not very pleasant ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651101233152
    m_Localized: "Great! Now the fun begins\u2026 or maybe not so fun for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1690984869888
    m_Localized: "Focus, and let\u2019s get started with the job. Well, not me\u2026
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1692792614912
    m_Localized: 'You only have one mission: make everything work. I trust you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1695720239104
    m_Localized: "As you can see, there\u2019s not much you can do without a heart,
      right? Do me a favor and read carefully how it works; otherwise, things won\u2019t
      go too well for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1697972580352
    m_Localized: "Mmh\u2026 can you\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1762678108160
    m_Localized: "You did great, but you could go a bit faster, you know? The patient
      doesn\u2019t have all day."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1766482341888
    m_Localized: Could you focus? This is important. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1767195373568
    m_Localized: "You\u2019re improving, but this isn\u2019t over yet. You\u2019ve
      finished the outer part, good."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1767811936256
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll have to make the heart work properly, and you\u2019d
      better do it right. That\u2019s a threat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838993469440
    m_Localized: Open the drawer on the right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1840071405568
    m_Localized: "Drag the heart inside and place it on the table. Don\u2019t take
      too long."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1841094815744
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026 it\u2019s not complete. Interesting. I hope you know
      how this works."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1842978058240
    m_Localized: "Great, keep it up! You need some encouragement too, or you\u2019ll
      lose motivation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1844534145024
    m_Localized: What are you trying to do, kill the patient? Do it properly, please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1928055320576
    m_Localized: Come on, keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1928927735808
    m_Localized: "Come on, you\u2019re almost done, but don\u2019t lose the rhythm."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1929686904832
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s not start like this, please. Do things mindfully\u2014think
      before you act."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1931482066944
    m_Localized: The last one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3359982317568
    m_Localized: "Phew, thank goodness! You\u2019ve finished the most important parts.
      Let\u2019s get out of here. But don\u2019t get too excited\u2014this isn\u2019t
      over yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3364927401984
    m_Localized: "You don\u2019t know the rhythm? Disastrous\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3367402041344
    m_Localized: "If you can\u2019t get the last step right, you won\u2019t get anywhere.
      Get it together and try again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3441859325952
    m_Localized: "Alright, now it\u2019s time to make everything work. You know how
      this goes. Let\u2019s go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3442563969024
    m_Localized: "Congratulations! You\u2019ve completed a big part of the job. You
      seem dedicated\u2014keep that consistency and don\u2019t lose focus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3443230863360
    m_Localized: "Come on, it can\u2019t be that hard. Remember everything you\u2019ve
      learned and apply it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
